---
description: Enforce mandatory logging for all system-critical changes
globs: ["**/*.ts", "**/*.json", "**/*.md"]
alwaysApply: true
ruleType: Always
---

* All changes to system architecture, agents, prompts, or governance logic must be recorded in `/cursor/auto-actions.log.md`.  
* Use present-tense summaries (e.g., “Refactored fallback pipeline”) and include filenames affected.  
* If any `gpt-templates/` file is modified, include the reason, prompt type, and output delta (if applicable).  
* Do not deploy or commit Codex-impacting changes without a matching log entry.  

